Description: TMOE - More Optional Environments (Python 3.10+)
 TMOE is a tool for managing Linux containers and GUI desktop environments,
 especially on Android/Termux. This is a complete rewrite in Python 3.10+.
 .
 Features:
  - Proot containers (no root required)
  - Chroot containers (root required)
  - Docker container support
  - GUI desktop installation (XFCE, LXDE, MATE, KDE, GNOME)
  - VNC/noVNC remote desktop
  - Application center with package manager integration
  - Mirror source management for China users
  - Container backup/restore
  - Cross-architecture support (QEMU)
  - Modern TUI interface using Textual
 .
 This package provides the Python implementation of TMOE,
 replacing the original shell script version.
